#: ../../source/is-glob_README.md:3
msgid ""
"Returns `true` if the given string looks like a glob pattern or an "
"extglob pattern. This makes it easy to create code that only uses "
"external modules like node-glob when necessary, resulting in much faster "
"code execution and initialization time, and a better user experience."
msgstr ""

